<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Electricity Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the electricity sphere call down and hurl lightning. Your ability in the sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist electricity spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>). Lightning finds its way past a shield: no shield is of any use against these spells. To resist electricity better, see <a cmd='#'>Help Electricity Resistance</a>; dragons may also breathe lightning (see <a cmd='#'>Help Breath</a>).
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level):
</p>
<pre>call lightning     no guild teaches it
lightning breath   no guild teaches it
electrical shock   sorcerer 3
jolt               sorcerer 16
lightning bolt     sorcerer 30
lightning storm    sorcerer 160
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Electricity Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sorcerer Spells</a>
</pre>




</div>